- 4KB Addressable Memory
- Includes Memory Mapped IO

# RAM (0x000 - 0x7FF, 2KB 8-Bit SRAM Chip)
    0x000 - 0x0FF    Zero Page (256 bytes)
                     Accessible using Register Pointers with R-type LOAD/STORE
                     Pointer Registers can access this by connecting the remaining
                         4 address bits to 0.

    0x100 - 0x1FF    Stack Page (256 bytes)
                     Accessible using Stack Pointer with R-type LOAD/STORE
                     Pointer Registers can access this by connecting the remaining
                         4 address bits to 0.
    
    0x100 - 0x7FF    Heap (~1.7KB)
                     I2-type only (LDRAM/STRAM)
                     For larger data structures that do not need
                         to be modified often

# PPU VRAM (0x800 - 0xC0F, 1.23KB MMIO PPU Registers)
    0x800 - 0xBBF    Tile Map
    0xBC0 - 0xBCF    Object Attribute Memory (Sprite Data)
    0xBD0 - 0xC0F    Color/Palette Map

# SPU RAM (0xC10 - 0xC4F, 64B MMIO SPU Registers)
    0xC10 - 0xC4F    Reserved for future sound card ideas

# Board LEDs (0xC50 - 0xC6F, 32B MMIO PWM Registers)
    0xC50 - 0xC6F    Reserved for future PWM controlled LED ideas

# Timer RAM (0xC70 - 0xC7F, 16B MMIO Timer Registers)
    0xC70 - 0xC7F    Reserved for future Timer Ideas

0xC80 - 0xFF4    Unassigned (reserved for expansion)

# Interrupt Registers (0xFF5 - 0xFFC, 8B Hardware Interrupt Addresses)
    0xFF5 - 0xFF6    Controller Select Interrupt Bytes
    0xFF7 - 0xFF8    Audio Pin 1 Interrupt Bytes
    0xFF9 - 0xFFA    Audio Pin 2 Interrupt Bytes
    0xFFB - 0xFFC    Timer Interrupt Bytes

